@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC03 Xem dashboard va bieu do thong ke theo vai tro

actor "Admin/Vendor/AnalyticsViewer" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - DashboardPage" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nAnalyticsController + AnalyticsService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nUnitOfWork + ApplicationDbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo dashboard
UI -> UI: Xac dinh vai tro hien tai

alt Admin hoac AnalyticsViewer
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau dashboard tong quan
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen analytics
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc so dem van hanh, AudioTrack va presence hien tai
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc POI, tour, QR, media, AudioTrack, narration va log nghe
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu tong hop
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra so dem dashboard va luot truy cap
  Business --> UI: Tra the thong ke, khach online va luot hom nay

  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau bieu do theo khoang thoi gian
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc log nghe theo ngay
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc NarrationLogs
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra log nghe
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra du lieu theo ngay
  Business --> UI: Tra line chart

  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau ti le nguon truy cap
  Business -> DataAccess: Tong hop QR, GPS va thu cong
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc NarrationLogs
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra log nghe
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra summary
  Business --> UI: Tra donut chart

  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau thong ke nhom
  Business -> DataAccess: Gom log theo gio, thu, ngay, tuan hoac thang
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc NarrationLogs theo bo loc
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra log nghe
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra grouped analytics
  Business --> UI: Tra bieu do cot theo nhom

  opt Actor la Admin
    UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau POI cho ban do
    Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI co toa do
    DataAccess -> Database: Doc POI
    Database --> DataAccess: Tra POI
    DataAccess --> Business: Tra danh sach POI
    Business --> UI: Tra marker ban do

    opt Actor chon marker POI
      UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau preview audio cua POI
      Business -> DataAccess: Doc AudioTrack active kem version va updatedAt
      DataAccess -> Database: Doc AudioTrack va POI
      Database --> DataAccess: Tra audio preview
      DataAccess --> Business: Tra danh sach audio
      Business --> UI: Tra audio preview bao ve CMS
    end
  end

  UI -> UI: Ve the so lieu, line chart, donut, cot nhom va ban do
else Vendor
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau danh sach sap cua Vendor
  Business -> Business: Ap dung owner hien tai
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI thuoc Vendor
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc POI
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra danh sach sap
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra sap cua Vendor
  Business --> UI: Tra danh sach sap

  alt Co sap chinh
    UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau dashboard tong quan theo Vendor
    Business -> DataAccess: Doc so dem POI, media, AudioTrack, narration, QR va presence cua sap
    DataAccess -> Database: Doc POI, MediaFile, AudioTrack, NarrationDraft, PoiTranslation va NarrationLogs
    Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu tong hop cua Vendor
    DataAccess --> Business: Tra so dem va active visitors theo sap
    Business --> UI: Tra the trang thai va chi so sap

    UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau bieu do theo khoang thoi gian cua sap
    Business -> Business: Kiem tra Vendor so huu POI
    Business -> DataAccess: Doc log nghe cua POI
    DataAccess -> Database: Doc NarrationLogs theo POI
    Database --> DataAccess: Tra log nghe
    DataAccess --> Business: Tra daily va summary
    Business --> UI: Tra line chart va donut chart

    UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau thong ke nhom cua sap
    Business -> Business: Kiem tra Vendor so huu POI
    Business -> DataAccess: Gom log cua POI theo bo loc
    DataAccess -> Database: Doc NarrationLogs theo POI
    Database --> DataAccess: Tra log nghe
    DataAccess --> Business: Tra grouped analytics
    Business --> UI: Tra bieu do cot theo nhom

    UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau co cau noi dung sap
    Business -> DataAccess: Doc anh, narration, AudioTrack va ban dich
    DataAccess -> Database: Doc MediaFile, NarrationDraft, AudioTrack va PoiTranslation
    Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu noi dung
    DataAccess --> Business: Tra thong ke noi dung
    Business --> UI: Tra cot ngang noi dung

    opt Sap cho thanh toan
      Actor -> UI: Chon thanh toan MoMo mo phong
      UI -> Business: Chuyen sang luong UC06
    end

    opt Vendor chon tac vu noi dung
      Actor -> UI: Chon anh, thuyet minh hoac ban dich
      UI -> UI: Dieu huong sang UC08, UC10 hoac UC07 voi poiId hien tai
    end

    UI -> UI: Ve trang thai sap, ban do, bieu do khach ghe va co cau noi dung
  else Chua co sap
    UI --> Actor: Hien thi trang thai trong va nut dang ky sap
  end
else Vai tro khong co dashboard chuyen biet
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi thong tin vai tro gioi han
end

alt Khong co quyen hoac Vendor khong so huu POI
  Business --> UI: Tu choi truy cap
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi thong bao khong co quyen
else Truy van loi
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi tai du lieu
else Thanh cong
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi dashboard va bieu do thong ke
end
@enduml
